# Push after changes

After any change to this project, commit the work and push it to `origin` on `main`.

- Do this in the same turn as the change, without waiting to be asked.
- Use the existing commit author: Ellipse Solar, ellipsesolarofficial@gmail.com. Do not change git config.
- Do not commit secrets (`.env`, credentials, tokens).
- Do not force-push.
- After the push, confirm the GitHub Pages deploy so the live site matches the repo.
